Package: com.rileytestut.altdaemon
Name: AltDaemon Modern
Version: 1.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Depends: ellekit (>= 1.2)
Description: Reliable rootless AltDaemon with current Apple login compatibility.
 AltDaemon allows compatible AltStore builds to install and refresh apps
 without a computer. This fork targets standard Dopamine rootless jailbreaks.
Maintainer: AltDaemonModern contributors
Author: Riley Testut and AltDaemonModern contributors
Homepage: https://github.com/altstoreio/AltStore
Section: Tweaks
